// Ch14 B07 "The first ripple" (C → E, 2.5 min) and B08 "Merel at the gate" (C, 1.5 min). act2_ch14.md §2.
// L01: the bridal barge slides off the bottom step; Merel in the stern with the pole; before she pushes off
// she lays her bridal cloth over Tobin without a word. Kerrid is LAST ONTO THE DECK. L02: the hero image:
// the barge moves on still water, a wake opens, the domes' reflections break apart: the first ripple in four
// hundred years. L03: the player poles three strokes with her (held input). L04: every bell in Ansedra (the
// stirring bells). L05: the city comes to its windows and watches the water move.
// B08: L06-L09: Rhen takes the pole; Merel stays to drop the water-gate; her father's Stillguard take her,
// still in wedding red, Tobin's blood on her sleeve. The camera holds from the barge and nobody looks away.
// Rhen keeps poling. He has to.
title: ch14_first_ripple
location: ch13/ansedra_lacquer_court
---
// The steps were held (B06): set here too, so the flag has a setter in the scene that follows the set piece.
<<set $ch14_steps_held = true>>
@letterbox on
@camera L01
@music lagoon_escape fade=0.5
@anim merel lay_cloth tobin
@wait 2.5
@mark kerrid barge_deck walk
@wait 1.5
@camera L02
@anim merel pole_push
@sfx pole_stroke
@wait 6.0
@camera L03
<<event hold_input pole_stroke>>
@anim merel pole_push
@sfx pole_stroke
@wait 2.0
@anim merel pole_push
@sfx pole_stroke
@wait 2.0
@anim merel pole_push
@sfx pole_stroke
@wait 2.0
<<event hold_input_end>>
@camera L04
@sfx stirring_bells
@wait 2.5
@camera L05
@wait 6.0
<<jump ch14_merel_at_the_gate>>
===
title: ch14_merel_at_the_gate
---
@camera L06
@anim rhen take_pole merel
@wait 1.5
@camera L07
@mark merel merel_gate walk
Rhen [afraid]: Merel. Get on. #line:ch14_gate_001
Merel [determined]: If the gate stays up, they're on you before the mouth. I can drop it. You can't, from there. #line:ch14_gate_002
Liss [grief]: Merel. #line:ch14_gate_003
Merel [sad]: I know. I know. Go. #line:ch14_gate_004
@camera L08
@anim merel pull_pin
@sfx water_gate_drop
@wait 2.5
@camera L09
@anim stillguard seize merel
@wait 6.0
@music silence fade=2.0
<<set $ch14_merel_taken = true>>
@letterbox off
<<event start_battle ch14_malcor_venn>>
===
